---
description: Use when the user asks where an agent session's time went, wants a session timeline, a time breakdown, or "where did the time go" for Claude Code, Codex or OpenCode.
alwaysApply: false
---

Run `python3.12 skills/agent-timeline/agent_timeline.py --open` (add `--no-detail` before the page is shared). It writes one self-contained HTML page and prints its path. Report the path and two or three findings from the numbers. Never put the session's text into a reply; the page already redacts it.

Cursor's own agent transcripts have no per-call timestamps and are not supported.
